coverage\":\"25% – 75% fee waiver\",\"criteria\":\"National or provincial level athletes. Nomination by CUI Lahore Sports Office. Performance reviewed annually.\"},\n  {\"name\":\"Orphan and Widows Children Scholarship\",\"type\":\"Need-Based\",\"coverage\":\"Up to 100% fee waiver\",\"criteria\":\"Applicant is an orphan or child of a widow. Income proof and family documents required. Verified by Student Affairs.\"}\n]', NULL, NULL),
