ship certificate required.\"},{\"name\":\"Kinship-Based Assistance\",\"type\":\"Internal\",\"coverage\":\"10% tuition fee concession for siblings studying concurrently at UOL.\",\"criteria\":\"Both siblings must be active students; renewable each semester.\"},{\"name\":\"HEC Need-cum-Merit Scholarship\",\"type\":\"External\",\"coverage\":\"Tuition fee + monthly stipend.\",\"criteria\":\"Family income verified by HEC; CGPA >= 2.5 maintained.\"},{\"name\":\"PEEF Scholarship (Punjab Educational Endowment Fund)\",\"type\":\"External\",\"coverage\":\"Full tuition fee.\",\"criteria\":\"Domicile of Punjab; family income below PKR 45,000/month; CGPA >= 2.0.\"}]', NULL, NULL),
