('602cc750-7a7e-4151-8525-a0680dcab56b', 'f104a9b5-f86e-42a5-ada7-de0405b07ef2', 'University of Lahore', 'university of lahore', 11, 'Private', '@uol.edu.pk', 'Ms. Munazza Waheed', 'munazza.waheed@uol.edu.pk', 'Lahore (Main Campus);Lahore (City Campus); Sargodha Campus;Islamabad Campus; Pakpattan Campus; Gujrat Campus', 6, '2026-11-09 17:04:46', 'At The University of Lahore, we prioritise your academic journey, offering world-class education, supportive environment, and opportunities to grow academically and personally. Your success drives our commitment to innovation, excellence, and community impact. To become a world-class university characterised by its excellence and contribution to society through 21st CENTURY SKILLED Education, Research, Entrepreneurship, and Internationalisation. The University of Lahore strives to achieve the following mission goals in pursuance of UOL vision: Produce graduates to become ready leaders through lifelong learning experience. Improve sustainability of the ecosystem which is vital for ensuring social and environmental wellbeing of society. Pursue and deliver academic excellence in every aspect of our endeavours. Reinforce the culture of research, innovation and commercialisation. Promote global flow of ideas, students and scholars through comprehensive internationalisation.', 'https://uol.edu.pk', 'admissions@uol.edu.pk', '+92-42-111-865-865', 'Lahore', '1-Km Defence Road, Near Bhuptian Chowk, Lahore, Pakistan 54792', '1999', 'https://uol.edu.pk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/the-logo.svg', 'https://uol.edu.pk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Frame-1639.png', NULL, 'Join the University of Lahore (UOL). Explore 150+ degree programs with world-class research and global rankings.', 'About', 'At The University of Lahore, we prioritise your academic journey, offering world-class education, supportive environment, and opportunities to grow academically and personally. Your success drives our commitment to innovation, excellence, and community impact. To become a world-class university characterised by its excellence and contribution to society through 21st CENTURY SKILLED Education, Research, Entrepreneurship, and Internationalisation. The University of Lahore strives to achieve the following mission goals in pursuance of UOL vision: Produce graduates to become ready leaders through lifelong learning experience. Improve sustainability of the ecosystem which is vital for ensuring social and environmental wellbeing of society. Pursue and deliver academic excellence in every aspect of our endeavours. Reinforce the culture of research, innovation and commercialisation. Promote global flow of ideas, students and scholars through comprehensive internationalisation.', 'The University of Lahore strives to achieve the following mission goals in pursuance of UOL vision: Pursue and deliver academic excellence in every aspect of our endeavours. Produce graduates to become future ready leaders through lifelong learning experience. Reinforce the culture of research, innovation and commercialisation. Improve sustainability of the ecosystem which is vital for ensuring social and environmental wellbeing of society. Promote global flow of ideas, students and scholars through comprehensive internationalisation.', 'To become a world-class university characterised by its excellence and contribution to society through 21st century skill-centred Education, Research, Entrepreneurship, and Internationalisation.', 'W4', 'HEC Category W4 | QS World 951-1000 (2026) | THE World 701-800 (2027) | 1st in Pakistan (UI GreenMetric 2026)', '36000', NULL, NULL, '6', 'uol.edu.pk', 'Lahore (Main Campus);Lahore (City Campus); Sargodha Campus;Islamabad Campus; Pakpattan Campus; Gujrat Campus', 1, '2026-10-14 10:39:52', '2026-11-09 17:04:46', 'Punjab', 'approved'),
