('af8ed5c5-abfd-4f9e-aa8c-f1c6b55e71ce', '85f5554a-b4f3-4219-a37c-69ed991821bf', 'The Superior University', 'the superior university', 35, 'Private', '@superior.edu.pk', 'Mr. Muhammad Nawaz Butt', 'nawaz.butt@superior.edu.pk', 'Lahore (Main Campus); Rahim Yar Khan Campus; Faisalabad Campus; Layyah Campus; Sargodha Campus', 5, '2026-11-09 17:04:46', 'Those who choose Superior University don’t just join an institution; they learn, question, innovate, teach, and grow. Becoming capable, shaping a legacy defined by better ideas, work, and future.  Our journey began in 2000 with the founding of Superior College Lahore. In 2003, the institution received its NOC from the Government of Punjab, followed by the establishment of a purpose-built campus at 17 KM Raiwind Road, Lahore in 2004. In 2008, Superior College Lahore was granted a Charter as a Degree Awarding Institute (DAI). HEC lists the university as established since 16 June 2004.  Today, Superior University is recognised nationally and internationally for its commitment to excellence in education and impact. While milestones and recognition reflect progress, our focus remains clear: preparing capable graduates who are ready to contribute meaningfully, locally and globally.', 'https://www.superior.edu.pk/', 'cms@superior.edu.pk', '042-38103777', 'Lahore', '17 KM, Main Raiwind Road, Lahore, Punjab', '2004', 'https://www.superior.edu.pk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Superior-University-Logo.svg', 'https://www.superior.edu.pk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Superior-university-admission-2026.png', 'Character | Courage | Competence', 'Admissions Open Fall 2026 | Discover your 3C Advantages', 'About Superior University', 'Those who choose Superior University don’t just join an institution; they learn, question, innovate, teach, and grow. Becoming capable, shaping a legacy defined by better ideas, work, and future.  Our journey began in 2000 with the founding of Superior College Lahore. In 2003, the institution received its NOC from the Government of Punjab, followed by the establishment of a purpose-built campus at 17 KM Raiwind Road, Lahore in 2004. In 2008, Superior College Lahore was granted a Charter as a Degree Awarding Institute (DAI). HEC lists the university as established since 16 June 2004.  Today, Superior University is recognised nationally and internationally for its commitment to excellence in education and impact. While milestones and recognition reflect progress, our focus remains clear: preparing capable graduates who are ready to contribute meaningfully, locally and globally.', 'We are committed to transform the lives of our students, faculty, staff and alumni by providing an excellent learning and research environment which ensures success in their personal, professional and spiritual lives. We believe in developing ‘Superheroes’ who can create social and economic impact by exhibiting character mastery and entrepreneurial mindset to build a sustainable community.', 'To become a leading Pakistani university driving excellence in learning, innovation, and research.', NULL, '1st overall ranked private-sector university in Pakistan; among 200 world’s most innovative universities in WURI 2026; THE Quality of Education 101–20', NULL, '100%', '43', '5', 'superior.edu.pk', 'Lahore (Main Campus); Rahim Yar Khan Campus; Faisalabad Campus; Layyah Campus; Sargodha Campus', 1, '2026-10-14 10:39:52', '2026-11-09 17:04:46', NULL, 'approved'),
